The license, attribution requirements, and reuse conditions stated on each canonical Zenodo record govern that publication and its downloadable files. Current canonical publication records are listed in RIGHTS_AND_REUSE.md and PUBLICATIONS.json.

The current canonical records for the following publications identify Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0) as the applicable license:

- UOHF V1.0: An Auditable Human-Function Inference and Safety-Constrained Decision-Support Framework, publication revision 1.0.1, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21630183;
- UOHF Definition 2.0: Unified Ontology of Human Function, publication revision 2.0.1, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21630339;
- UOHF Definition 2.1: Unified Ontology of Human Function, publication revision 2.1.1, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21630406;
